{"title":"广州市印发《2025广州市自主可控BIM应用与发展白皮书》","date":"2025-12-12","content":"<section class=\"_editor\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">广州市印发《2025广州市自主可控BIM应用与发展白皮书》</span></strong></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202512/1-1.png\" style=\"width: 100%;\" /></p>\r\n\t<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t<section class=\"_editor\" data-style-id=\"68119\" data-support=\"96编辑器\" style=\"margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"background-color:#FDFFDB;padding:0px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background-color:#EB2501;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"width:10px;height:10px;background-color:#EB2501;margin-left:auto;margin-bottom:unset;overflow:hidden;line-height:0;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"margin:0px 10px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<section style=\"padding:20px 15px;background-color:#fefefe;border:1px dashed #834d24;border-radius:27px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-bottom:unset;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); word-break: break-all; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;line-height:1.75em;font-size:17px;\">市新型建筑工业化联席会议各成员单位，各相关单位：</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color:#424242;word-break:break-all;font-family:宋体;line-height:1.75em;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:16px;text-indent:2.4em;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;font-size:17px;\">根据住建部&ldquo;新城建&rdquo;产业与应用示范基地试点工作，推进自主可控建筑信息模型（BIM）技术的研究与应用的要求，为进一步引导社会各界积极参与我市新型城市基础设施建设等试点工作，市新型建筑工业化联席会议办公室组织编制了《2025广州市自主可控BIM应用与发展白皮书》，总结了广州市自主可控BIM应用发展试点探索与实践经验，现予印发，供各单位参考。如有问题，请径向市新型建筑工业化联席会议办公室反映。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); word-break: break-all; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;font-size:17px;\">特此通知。</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"color: rgb(66, 66, 66); word-break: break-all; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 1.75em; font-size: 15px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;font-size:17px;\">　</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:10px;line-height:2;color:#424242;word-break:break-all;font-size:16px;text-align:right;font-family:宋体;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;font-size:17px;\">　　广州市新型建筑工业化联席会议办公室（代章）</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:10px;line-height:2;color:#424242;word-break:break-all;font-size:16px;text-align:right;font-family:宋体;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;font-size:17px;\">　　2025年12月9日</span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:10px;line-height:2;color:#424242;word-break:break-all;font-size:16px;text-align:right;font-family:宋体;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-bottom:10px;line-height:2;color:#424242;word-break:break-all;font-size:16px;text-align:center;font-family:宋体;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">　　（联系人：江先生，</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;\">联系电话：020-81999512、18026364686）</span></span></p>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: justify; letter-spacing: 1px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t\t<section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:unse